  <metadata>
    <name>B&amp;U DM 2026: Linjeløbet i Vejle</name>
    <desc>The road race at the Danish youth championships, B&amp;U DM 2026, in Vejle on Sunday 30 August 2026: a one-way lap of 10 km from the finish at Vejledalen (toppen), down Sleldevej, through the valley and up Vardevej to the finish at the top. From the race's own route file (made on plotaroute.com, published by Vejle Cykelklub with the race: https://www.sportstiming.dk/event/17480), heights as in that file.</desc>
  </metadata>
